le` always true means filesystem errors in `docs/public/schemas/` become hard failures. The plan acknowledges the silent-skip behavior but doesn't flag this as an edge case for unusual environments. Worth adding.\n\n**Review Item 17**: `CLAUDE.md` in STRIP_FILES — implementing agent shouldn't accidentally remove it from SOP when editing. Minor safety note for Step 5.2.\n\n**Review Item 18**: STRIP_DIRS vs INTERNAL_FILES_TO_STRIP distinction with trailing slashes. Plan is already correct. No change needed.\n\n**Q1 (Vercel vercel.json)**: This is the same as Review Item 9 — significant. I need to address this.\n\n**Q2 (docs/bun.lock)**: Already addressed in Item 8.\n\n**Q3 (CI pagefind time)**: Minor — informational for the implementing agent. Worth a brief note.\n\n**Q4 (setup-environment gemini)**: Plan already correctly passes `install-gemini: \"false\"`. Confirmed.\n\n**Q5 (peerDependencies mismatch)**: Root has `\"typescript\": \"^5.9.2\"` as peerDep, docs has `\"typescript\": \"^5.0.0\"` as devDep. Bun workspace hoisting could produce a warning. Worth noting as edge case.\n\n**Small Correction 1**: Remove \"approximately\" — agree.\n\n**Small Correction 2**: Show TypeScript template literal form — agree.\n\n**Small Correction 3**: Biome key is `\"files\": { \"includes\": [...] }` — informational, not a plan change.\n\n**Small Correction 4**: Summary table incomplete for `.gitignore` — agree, should mention all additions.\n\n**Small Correction 5**: Dev command assumes `bun install` was run — worth noting in Step 5.4.\n\n**Structural Gap**: `docs/` pre-existence check — simple safety note.\n\n**Code Inspection**: Validation phase `git diff --name-only schemas/` should also check `docs/public/schemas/` — this is a real gap.\n\nAlso, I noticed a factual error in the plan: Step 3.1 says `snapshotSync()` is a consumer of `STRIP_DIRS`. It's not — `snapshotSync()` copies the pre-built snapshot, which was already stripped by `prepareSnapshot()`. The actual consumers are only `prepareSnapshot()` (line 214) and `initialSync()` (line 291). I need to fix this.\n\nNow let me make the targeted edits to the plan."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":382,"cache_read_input_tokens":68852,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":382},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0699f0ac-31c0-43c3-bcfd-da3fdd996bc7","uuid":"5a748cad-3c70-48da-9030-9946e1fd3730","timestamp":"2026-03-05T13:09:32.023Z"}
