{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01TNwkH7HUq1yfQgxoHx8cqk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01DZdpXtHa2Loo2Jg829GZTb","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/philip/projects/hw-budget-tests/plan-gen-execution/agentRoot/plan/merged/plan.md","old_string":"```markdown\n### Documentation site\n\nThe documentation site is a Bun workspace at `docs/`. To work on it locally:\n\n    cd docs && bun run dev    # Development server with hot reload\n    cd docs && bun run build  # Production build\n\nChanges to docs pages (`docs/content/**/*.mdx`) deploy automatically via Vercel when\npushed to the configured branch.\n\nSchema generation writes to both `schemas/` (for the npm package) and\n`docs/public/schemas/` (for the docs site):\n\n    bun run generate-schemas\n```","new_string":"```markdown\n### Documentation site\n\nThe documentation site is a Bun workspace at `docs/`. To work on it locally,\nfirst ensure dependencies are installed from the repo root (`bun install`), then:\n\n    cd docs && bun run dev    # Development server with hot reload (uses --turbopack)\n    cd docs && bun run build  # Production build\n\nChanges to docs pages (`docs/content/**/*.mdx`) deploy automatically via Vercel when\npushed to the configured branch.\n\nSchema generation writes to both `schemas/` (for the npm package) and\n`docs/public/schemas/` (for the docs site):\n\n    bun run generate-schemas\n```"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":459,"cache_read_input_tokens":86930,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":459},"output_tokens":414,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0699f0ac-31c0-43c3-bcfd-da3fdd996bc7","uuid":"1ef43ae2-91c7-41dd-aa3b-5aae8a819704","timestamp":"2026-03-05T13: