om the same source), but including the check keeps the warning accurate.\n\n2. **Validation phase revert** (around line 436): The `git checkout` that reverts test schema generation currently only covers `schemas/`. Extend it to also revert `docs/public/schemas/`:\n\n```typescript\nawait exec(\"git checkout -- schemas/ docs/public/schemas/ 2>/dev/null || true\", {\n  silent: true,\n  allowFailure: true,\n});\n```\n\nNote on error handling: if `docs/public/schemas/` does not yet exist in the git index (e.g., schemas have never been generated and committed), `git checkout -- docs/public/schemas/` will fail. This is handled at two levels: the shell-level `2>/dev/null || true` suppresses the error output and exit code, and the `allowFailure: true` option prevents the `exec()` helper from throwing. Both are maintained in the proposed change.","numLines":15,"startLine":418,"totalLines":891}},"timestamp":"2026-03-05T13:13:07.462Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01SaTZJHm435Qv7BJFm7rQmS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019wik5x25NEqMGDvtnf8Ahu","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/philip/projects/hw-budget-tests/plan-gen-execution/agentRoot/plan/merged/plan.md","old_string":"Note on error handling: if `docs/public/schemas/` does not yet exist in the git index (e.g., schemas have never been generated and committed), `git checkout -- docs/public/schemas/` will fail. This is handled at two levels: the shell-level `2>/dev/null || true` suppresses the error output and exit code, and the `allowFailure: true` option prevents the `exec()` helper from throwing. Both are maintained in the proposed change.","new_string":"The implementing agent should copy the exact structure of the existing line at line 436 and extend the path string only — do not refactor the error handling pattern. The existing code uses a belt-and-suspenders approach: shell-level `2>/dev/null || true` suppresses the error output and exit code, AND `allowFailure: true` prevents the `exec()` helper from throwing. Both are redundant with each other but both must be maintained because this is the existing pattern in the file. If `docs/public/schemas/` does not yet exist in the git index (e.g., schemas have never been generated and committed), `git checkout -- docs/public/schemas/` will fail, and both error suppression levels handle this gracefully."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":739,"cache_read_input_tokens":88602,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":739},"output_tokens":403,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0699f0ac-31c0-43c3-bcfd-da3fdd996bc7","uuid":"817c1d2c-7878-4583-a908-05325784a967","timestamp":"2026-0